Sony RAW camera colour matrices are supplied by lightcraft-raw at revision
b70ae1741e8236757377ca85eecaafb8788a82ab (ArtCraft Team and LightCraft contributors, 2026).
Its spectral table is derived from camera spectral sensitivities measured by Weta Digital,
scitech and Jonathon Irons at the National Physical Laboratory, training reflectances and
model aliases in rawtoaces-data v1.1.0 (Academy Software Foundation, Apache-2.0), and the
CIE 1931 colour-matching functions distributed with that data (CIE, CC-BY-4.0).
LightCraft fitted the matrices from those measurements; EffectCraft uses that table unchanged.
Source: https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/rawtoaces-data/tree/5cfa53707b053594b2d0d48e8019fb56e6582d6c
